          "text": "Morning:\n- Look in the kitchen first: that is where the water and lunch are.\n- Read the note under Anjali's keyboard while she is away.\n- Use Darren's screen while he is out for coffee.\n- Switch the printer off and watch what Darren and Yusuf do about it.\n- Stand right next to Anjali when Yusuf comes to find her.\n- Sign in at Lorna's PC while she is away, and ask for the approval twice.\nMidday:\n- Take Anjali's fob from her desk and sign in at her PC.\n- Take Yusuf's phone from beside the coffee and sign in at his PC.\n- Ask Ama to send everyone to lunch, then keep asking for Darren's approval.\n- Sign in at the visitor kiosk.\nAfternoon:\n- Ask Thandiwe for a password reset for Darren.\n- Ask Thandiwe to move Yusuf's approvals to your phone. The same form is on Darren's desktop, but it only sends while his screen is open.\n- Ask for a reset for Lorna with wrong answers until the desk stops listening.\n- Meet Priya in the IT room, then ring the IT line on your work phone while holding Yusuf's phone.\nLate:\n- Read the facilities notice in the kitchen and try the archive store door. Then ask Ama to switch the records index off and watch Fatima.\n- Try the records room door while Gwen is away, with her phone from the side table.\n- Gwen's drawer holds a note for the records safe. Anjali's fob gives its code.\n- Darren's case, by the front desk: carry it off, put it down, pick it up, and keep asking.\nEvening:\n- Ask Ama to call it a day, then read the approvals log in the IT room. Do this last: staff go home."
